[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755895977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104671#issuecomment-2755895977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104671","id":2755895977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kQ6Kp","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T22:38:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T22:38:38Z","body":"Godot 4.4 uses async map iterations by default which are threaded and sync on their own terms when the started map build is actually done.\n\nIn Godot 4.3 everything happened single-threaded as the only option so force updating map properties naturally caused the map graph to updated, usually followed by causing major performance problem due to the entire build running on the main thread.\n\nThe asyn map iterations can be toggled in the ProjectSettings or with the NavigationServer API.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755895977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755921922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104671#issuecomment-2755921922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104671","id":2755921922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kRAgC","user":{"login":"dougVanny","id":131491787,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9Znyw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131491787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny","html_url":"https://github.com/dougVanny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dougVanny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T22:57:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T22:57:59Z","body":"I see. Disabling it did help, and so does surround my map_force_update call like this\n\n```\nNavigationServer3D.map_set_use_async_iterations(map_rid, false);\nNavigationServer3D.map_force_update(map_rid);\nNavigationServer3D.map_set_use_async_iterations(map_rid, true);\n```\n\nI wonder what this change means for `map_force_update` though, as, to my understanding, it is only useful when you immediately need to have the map synced. Would it make sense to have `map_force_update` always work on a single thread or to maybe have that as an additional parameter?\n\nIt might be interesting to at least mention this on the [Upgrading from Godot 4.3 to Godot 4.4](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.html) doc if there are no plans to change this behavior","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755921922/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756309396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104671#issuecomment-2756309396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104671","id":2756309396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kSfGU","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T02:37:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T11:47:22Z","body":"That function should just be deprecated and removed later as it is incompatible with async updates, enables mountains of project code smell that bites users at a later point in their projects, and had a big disclaimer from the very start when it was added for a reason.\n\nTo be clear, not removing that function anytime soon, likely not before Godot 5 because some projects clearly make use of it, but it cant be updated going forward.\n\nIt does not work outside of a full single-threaded context. When maps, regions, navmeshes and more all update async on their own a user cant force a map update and get the result that the user would expect. And then add threads to the mix and even more does not work anymore. There is no way to keep this function alive going forward. It does not help, users need to craft code that is robust enough that it can work with the normal (a)sync flow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756309396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819671728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104671#issuecomment-2819671728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104671","id":2819671728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oEMaw","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T23:04:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T23:04:13Z","body":"Closing as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104762 marks the function deprecated and explains why and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104826 adds new NavigationServer api to better query the sync state of regions (for maps it already exists).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819671728/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]